{"page":128,"verses":[{"verse_key":"6:1","surah":6,"ayah":1,"ar_uthmani":" ٱلْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ ٱلَّذِى خَلَقَ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضَ وَجَعَلَ ٱلظُّلُمَـٰتِ وَٱلنُّورَ ۖ ثُمَّ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ بِرَبِّهِمْ يَعْدِلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Praise belongs to God who created the heavens and the earth and made darkness and light; yet the disbelievers set up equals to their Lord!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱلْحَمْدُ","en_gloss":"(All) the praises and thanks","transliteration":"al-ḥamdu","verse_key":"6:1"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لِلَّهِ","en_gloss":"(be) to Allah","transliteration":"lillahi","verse_key":"6:1"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"6:1"},{"pos":4,"ar":"خَلَقَ","en_gloss":"created","transliteration":"khalaqa","verse_key":"6:1"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"6:1"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضَ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍa","verse_key":"6:1"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَجَعَلَ","en_gloss":"and made","transliteration":"wajaʿala","verse_key":"6:1"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلظُّلُمَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"the darkness[es]","transliteration":"l-ẓulumāti","verse_key":"6:1"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَٱلنُّورَ ۖ","en_gloss":"and the light","transliteration":"wal-nūra","verse_key":"6:1"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"6:1"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"6:1"},{"pos":12,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieved","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"6:1"},{"pos":13,"ar":"بِرَبِّهِمْ","en_gloss":"in their Lord","transliteration":"birabbihim","verse_key":"6:1"},{"pos":14,"ar":"يَعْدِلُونَ","en_gloss":"equate others with Him","transliteration":"yaʿdilūna","verse_key":"6:1"},{"pos":15,"ar":"١","en_gloss":"(1)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:1"}]},{"verse_key":"6:2","surah":6,"ayah":2,"ar_uthmani":"هُوَ ٱلَّذِى خَلَقَكُم مِّن طِينٍ ثُمَّ قَضَىٰٓ