s":"(5)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:5"}]},{"verse_key":"6:6","surah":6,"ayah":6,"ar_uthmani":"أَلَمْ يَرَوْا۟ كَمْ أَهْلَكْنَا مِن قَبْلِهِم مِّن قَرْنٍ مَّكَّنَّـٰهُمْ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ مَا لَمْ نُمَكِّن لَّكُمْ وَأَرْسَلْنَا ٱلسَّمَآءَ عَلَيْهِم مِّدْرَارًا وَجَعَلْنَا ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرَ تَجْرِى مِن تَحْتِهِمْ فَأَهْلَكْنَـٰهُم بِذُنُوبِهِمْ وَأَنشَأْنَا مِنۢ بَعْدِهِمْ قَرْنًا ءَاخَرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Do they not realize how many generations We destroyed before them? We established them in the earth more firmly than you, sent down abundant rain on them from the sky and made running rivers flow at their feet, yet We destroyed them for their misdeeds and raised other generations after them.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَلَمْ","en_gloss":"Did not","transliteration":"alam","verse_key":"6:6"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَرَوْا۟","en_gloss":"they see","transliteration":"yaraw","verse_key":"6:6"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كَمْ","en_gloss":"how many","transliteration":"kam","verse_key":"6:6"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَهْلَكْنَا","en_gloss":"We destroyed","transliteration":"ahlaknā","verse_key":"6:6"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"6:6"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قَبْلِهِم","en_gloss":"before them","transliteration":"qablihim","verse_key":"6:6"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"6:6"},{"pos":8,"ar":"قَرْنٍۢ","en_gloss":"generations","transliteration":"qarnin","verse_key":"6:6"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَّكَّنَّـٰهُمْ","en_gloss":"We had established them","transliteration":"makkannāhum","verse_key":"6:6"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"6:6"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"6:6"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"6:6"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لَمْ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"6:6"},{"pos":14,"ar":"نُمَكِّن","en_gloss":"We (have) established","transliteration":"numakkin","v