ينٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Even if We had sent down to you [Prophet] a book inscribed on parchment, and they had touched it with their own hands, the disbelievers would still say, ‘This is nothing but blatant sorcery.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"And (even) if","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"6:7"},{"pos":2,"ar":"نَزَّلْنَا","en_gloss":"We (had) sent down","transliteration":"nazzalnā","verse_key":"6:7"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَلَيْكَ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ʿalayka","verse_key":"6:7"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كِتَـٰبًۭا","en_gloss":"a written Scripture","transliteration":"kitāban","verse_key":"6:7"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"6:7"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قِرْطَاسٍۢ","en_gloss":"a parchment","transliteration":"qir'ṭāsin","verse_key":"6:7"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَلَمَسُوهُ","en_gloss":"and they touched it","transliteration":"falamasūhu","verse_key":"6:7"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِأَيْدِيهِمْ","en_gloss":"with their hands","transliteration":"bi-aydīhim","verse_key":"6:7"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَقَالَ","en_gloss":"surely (would) have said","transliteration":"laqāla","verse_key":"6:7"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"6:7"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كَفَرُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieved","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"6:7"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِنْ","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"6:7"},{"pos":13,"ar":"هَـٰذَآ","en_gloss":"(is) this","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"6:7"},{"pos":14,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"6:7"},{"pos":15,"ar":"سِحْرٌۭ","en_gloss":"magic","transliteration":"siḥ'run","verse_key":"6:7"},{"pos":16,"ar":"مُّبِينٌۭ","en_gloss":"clear","transliteration":"mubīnun","verse_key":"6:7"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٧","en_gloss":"(7)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:7"}]},{"verse_key":"6:8","surah":6,"ayah":8,"ar_uthmani":"وَقَالُوا۟ لَوْلَآ أُنزِلَ عَلَيْهِ مَلَكٌ ۖ وَلَوْ أَنزَلْنَا مَلَكًا لَّقُضِىَ ٱ